  "downloads": 66,
  "description": "<p>Stash Management Helper is an awesome mod with a great feature that will place auto-sort items from the bottom up. This is a custom sorting strategy config that I find works best for sorting in that order.</p>\n<p>Money, meds, food, ammo, and mags are all near the top for easier gear up, bulky items, containers, and junk go to the bottom.</p>\n<p>This gives you a nice workspace at the top of the stash. I suggest pining small containers at the top for easy unloading.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtube.com/shorts/5OMxQ7kvidc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://youtube.com/shorts/5OMxQ7kvidc</a></p>\n",
